From c1dfa907b81acfb6a01b3745a4cf67bb4a17e5cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 10:53:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix client crash on Skills section: R3F 9 + drei 10 + React
 19.2, 2D fallback boundary

@react-three/fiber v8 reads React internals removed in React 19 (Next 15 app router),
throwing 'Cannot read properties of undefined (reading ReactCurrentOwner)' when the 3D
orbit mounted on scroll. Upgrade to R3F 9 / drei 10 / React 19.2 and wrap the orbit in an
error boundary that falls back to the 2D orbit. Also show real skill count.
